*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]  Verification of 5GC001857-A
...               Scope : Test number of allocated PRB to RACH Msg2
...                       In the past there was another TC checking another value for
...                       the number fo PRB allocated to Msg3
...                       This TC is no more possible because it relied on mmW flexible
...                       frame structure which is no more available.
...                       08-10-2021              |           1857 refactoring
...                       02-11-2021              |           FR2 classical added
...                       25-11-2021              |           Changed to LOKI config
...                       10-May-2022             |           Remove 22R2 tag
...                       02-Jun-2022             |           Change expNumPrb=0x00000003 into expNumPrb=0x0003

Resource          ./5GC001857-A_PRACH_CI_Common.robot

Force Tags                          CA_5G_SW_FR-Villarceaux    RRM 
...   PY36
...                                 CONFIGURED    5G_RAN    RAN_5G    CRT
...                                 CLOUD_5G_I_LO_AP_LO_NSA_FS_ECPRI_MMWV_TDD    master_classicalbts_all
...                                 SBTS00       SBTS23R1    SBTS22R4

Suite Setup                         Suite Setup From Scratch
Suite Teardown                      Suite Teardown

# listBackupFiles=${FD_ALL} will save and restore all configuration files
Test Setup                          Test Setup for 1857
Test Teardown                       Test Teardown for 1857

*** Variables ***

@{bipMsgfilter}                     UlData_PuschReceiveReq


*** Test Cases ***
[1][1.0] 5GC001857-A_20_MSG3_with_3_PRBs
    [Documentation]                 Check if the number of PRB allocated to Msg3 has the right value
    ...                             according to slot configuration.

    Restart TL
    Run    sed -i 's/set_ue simulated id=11 /set_ue simulated id=1 /g' ${tl.core.dir_path}/${tl.core.cfg_filename}
    Run    sed -i 's/ue_param id=11 /ue_param id=1 /g' ${tl.core.dir_path}/${tl.core.cfg_filename}

    WTS Setup

    # Cellsetup is now done, Sherpa can be enabled if needed
    Run Keyword If                  ${enable_sherpa} == ${True}           Activate Sherpa

    # UE attach to 4G+5G (NSA) and capture Msg3 to check number of allcoated PRBs.
    ${CaptureBIP}                   Capture L1L2 Set Upon Config             airscale=${GNB_DU}
    Capture Init                    ${CaptureBIP}                            withTN=True
    ${CaptureBIP.filter}            Get Filter For Particular Msgs           bipMsgList=${bipMsgfilter}

    SgNB Addition to ENB             ueSetting=${UE_SIMPLE}     captureCallback=Callback Capture L1L2
    ...                              capture=${CaptureBIP}

    # Check number of PRBs
    Check Msg3 with X PRBs          ${CaptureBIP.path}           expNumPrb=3

    # Detach UE
    UE Detach Enb                   ueSetting=${UE_SIMPLE}
